{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/ea35a201b532f3ff0ead777eae9430c9.poster.avif?t=1768240746\" width=650 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/ea35a201b532f3ff0ead777eae9430c9.webm?t=1768240746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A mission to complete, a submarine to manage, lives to protect. In Magnavis, your crew\u2019s fate depends on your skills and teamwork. Navigate dangerous depths, repair failing systems, and confront unknown threats lurking underwater. Get ready to dive, stay alert, and fight to survive.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/e3328b74e5ac4dbf602fd13cc82e0aa9.webp?t=1768240746\" width=704 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/aee7dc915c47c0e0a2315c3daaabf213.poster.avif?t=1768240746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/aee7dc915c47c0e0a2315c3daaabf213.webm?t=1768240746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/aee7dc915c47c0e0a2315c3daaabf213.mp4?t=1768240746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Keep your submarine\u2019s systems online, fix issues, and prevent water from flooding in.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engine Core:</strong> Single power source\u2014if depleted, systems shut down and the sub explodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machine Maintenance:</strong> Inspect machines and repair faults immediately.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oxygen Management:</strong> If oxygen runs out, the crew can\u2019t survive\u2014intervene before levels get critical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hull Integrity:</strong> Cracks let water in\u2014patch the hull and stop leaks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/ee54ca9a48b132b32d014b2c72099020.webp?t=1768240746\" width=704 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/0e9c9f1f3c9733c0c09a570258949edc.poster.avif?t=1768240746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/0e9c9f1f3c9733c0c09a570258949edc.webm?t=1768240746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/0e9c9f1f3c9733c0c09a570258949edc.mp4?t=1768240746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Take missions from stations; each run offers different maps and objectives. Complete main and side missions to keep your crew alive.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Maps:</strong> Maps, objectives, and challenges are randomly generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main &amp; Side Missions:</strong> Main missions drive progress; side missions yield extra rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Station Visits:</strong> Stop by stations to accept new assignments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewards:</strong> Earn a fresh Engine Core and currency for each successful run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk &amp; Reward: Higher difficulty brings bigger payouts\u2014but failure puts everyone at risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/7c3f99dfc1e00625fe0fe7841599233d.webp?t=1768240746\" width=704 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/95a98615a662b8480fd26944513cedb8.poster.avif?t=1768240746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/95a98615a662b8480fd26944513cedb8.webm?t=1768240746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474070/extras/95a98615a662b8480fd26944513cedb8.mp4?t=1768240746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Caves are generated randomly each mission, making every run unique.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Caves:</strong> New pathways and exploration areas every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrow &amp; Wide Areas:</strong> Adjust your strategy for tight tunnels or open chambers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing Hazards:</strong> Creature spawns, resources, and obstacles relocate on each dive.</p></li></ul><p clas